w('about.html','About Us','Why Rent A Friend exists: companionship that is safe, respectful and on your terms.',f'''{head("About us","We believe everyone deserves good company.")}<section class="section tight"><div class="container prose"><p>Rent A Friend connects adults who want company with people happy to share their time: over coffee, on a walk, at an event or with a study session. It is strictly platonic.</p><h2>What we stand for</h2><ul><li>Safety and consent before everything else.</li><li>Transparent pricing and clear policies.</li><li>Respect for boundaries on both sides.</li></ul><p class="hint">[Company details, team and registered address to be added.]</p></div></section>''')
def legal(fn,t,intro,secs):
    b=head(t,intro)+'<section class="section tight"><div class="container prose"><p class="alert-box"><strong>Template draft.</strong> Not legally reviewed. Operator: [Company legal name] · Jurisdiction: [Country/State] · Contact: [email] · Final legal review: [pending].</p>'+''.join(f'<h2>{h}</h2>{x}' for h,x in secs)+'</div></section>'
    w(fn,t,intro,b)
legal('terms.html','Terms and Conditions','Initial template for platform use.',[("Eligibility","<p>You must be 18 or older. Underage use is prohibited.</p>"),("Companionship only","<p>The platform is for platonic companionship. Sexual services, romantic solicitation, harassment, coercion, discrimination, illegal activity and inappropriate behaviour are prohibited and may lead to removal.</p>"),("Verification","<p>Profiles are listed only after a manual review by our team. “Reviewed by team” means an administrator approved the application; it is not a government ID check unless an ID-verification provider is added. Profiles labelled Sample are fictional.</p>"),("Bookings, cancellation and refunds","<p>Draft: free cancellation over 24 hours before start; 50% charge within 24 hours; refunds where a friend cancels or fails to attend. [To be finalised.]</p>"),("Platform role and limits","<p>The platform is a marketplace. Users are responsible for their own conduct and safety. Liability limits: [to be defined by counsel].</p>"),("Reporting and blocking","<p>Users can report and block profiles. Misuse of reporting may lead to action.</p>")])
legal('privacy.html','Privacy Policy','How personal information would be handled. Template draft.',[("What we collect","<p>Account details, profile information, booking details and, for verification, identity checks via an approved provider. [Specify.]</p>"),("How it is protected","<p>Passwords are hashed on the server and never stored in plain text. Your browser keeps a login cookie and your appearance preference. Uploaded photos are stored on the server. This version does not collect identity documents.</p>"),("Your rights","<p>You can delete your account yourself under Dashboard, Account settings. Other requests: [contact email]. Applicable law: [jurisdiction].</p>"),("Sharing","<p>Information is shared only as needed to run bookings, verification and safety. [Processors list.]</p>")])
